span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"></span></span></strong><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">其他板块上有几个也已经回调到位了，比如商业百货、国际贸易、农药兽药。这样连续大阴线跌到颈线位，大概率也会给反弹。自己把握就行了。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">....................</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">国庆节马上就要到了，如果你账户里有闲钱的话，一定要买国债逆回购。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">我今天用最通俗易懂的语言，把国债逆回购详细说清楚。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">国债逆回购就是有持有国债的机构，把国债抵押给你，从你手里借钱，非常安全，你空仓的钱就可以买它，买一天就有一天的利息。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">但是一定要在周四买，而不要在周五买，同理，十一前也要在</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">29</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">号之前买，</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">号再买就晚了。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">因为他的计息是算从钱到你账户里那天开始，到你能把钱提取出来那天结束。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">比如你周四买</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">天的国债，是周五钱到你的账户里，但是下周一才能提取，这中间隔了三天，所以周四买能吃到周末的利息。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">但如果周五买</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">天的，下周一钱到你账户里，周二可以提取，只间隔了一天，所以周五买只能吃一天的利息。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">总之，你只要记住是在节前的第二天买，而不是在节前的那一天买就可以了。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">再说下细节。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">他分两个市场，沪市</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">天期代码是</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">204001</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">天的是</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">204002.</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">以此类推。但是最少十万才能买，利息稍微高那么一点。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">深市的比较难记，</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">天期是</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">131810</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">天的是</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">131811</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">他最长的期限是</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">182</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">天，代码是</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">131806</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">，千万别买错了，不然你的资金</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">182</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">天都不能用了。不过大家的软件上应该都有提示。这个</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">千块钱就能买，利息稍微低那么一点。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-ratio=\"0.2616487455197133\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMNq5KPEgokJJ10EnP5dCZ45785aryu3lVxsRpeU62rniavoDyIxQcAAIkpupsPYKSYHxp1hkFey3hA/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1674\" style=\"\"/></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span></strong><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">它的价格就是年化利率，比如</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">204007</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">，现在的价格是</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">3.7</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">，也就是说年化利率是</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">3.7%</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">平时的利率也就是</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">2.5%</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">左右，每个月的月末利率都会上升，因为银行月末都比较缺钱，所以会给短期高利率。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">还有</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">个细节</span></span></strong></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">，是国债逆回购</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">点半才收盘，也就是说</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">点收盘后，还有半个小时可以买。但是利率一般都会跌很多。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">是要直接点卖出而不是点买入。至于为什么，只需要记住国债逆回购里有个逆字，卖出国债逆回购，负负得正，就相当于买入国债，这样就好理解了。</span></span></strong></p></div>",
